  "title": "FLOWERS FOODS DECLARES QUARTERLY DIVIDEND",
  "summary": "Flowers Foods, Inc. (NYSE: FLO) today announced that its board of directors has declared a quarterly dividend of $0.2475 per share, an increase of 3.1% over the same quarter last year. This is the 93rd consecutive quarterly dividend paid by the company and is payable on December 12, 2025, to shareholders of record on November...",
